  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Updates Sepo agent infrastructure from **v0.2.0** to **v0.3.1** (c058dba69a2773cd5837b1d2a5883a1042ee26b5)\n- Syncs `.agent/` source (TypeScript, docs, templates) and all `.github/` agent workflows/actions/prompts\n- Key new capabilities in v0.3.0–v0.3.1: model policy / model selection support, followup-intent classification, runtime-env isolation, answer-review context, OIDC auth improvements\n\n## Source\n\n- **Source repo/ref:** `self-evolving/repo@v0.3.1`\n- **Source SHA:** `c058dba69a2773cd5837b1d2a5883a1042ee26b5`\n- **Target branch:** `main`\n\n## Audit Summary\n\n| Path group | Status |\n|---|---|\n| `.agent/` (src, docs, templates, package.json) | ✅ Safe replace — all agent-owned |\n| `.agent/src/followup-intent.ts` | ✅ New file added |\n| `.agent/src/answer-review-context.ts` | ✅ New file added |\n| `.agent/src/runtime-env.ts` | ✅ New file added |\n| `.agent/src/__tests__/followup-intent.test.ts` | ✅ New test added |\n| `.agent/src/__tests__/resolve-github-auth-oidc-shell.test.ts` | ✅ New test added |\n| `.agent/src/__tests__/runtime-env.test.ts` | ✅ New test added |\n| `.github/actions/resolve-agent-provider/action.yml` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/actions/resolve-agent-provider/resolve-provider.js` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/actions/resolve-github-auth/exchange-oidc.sh` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/actions/run-agent-task/action.yml` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/prompts/_base.md`, `agent-answer.md`, `agent-dispatch.md` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/prompts/agent-update.md` | ✅ New prompt added |\n| `.github/prompts/followup-intent.md` | ✅ New prompt added |\n| `.github/workflows/agent-entrypoint.yml`, `agent-fix-pr.yml`, `agent-review.yml`, `agent-router.yml`, `agent-update.yml` | ✅ Safe replace — agent-owned |\n| `.github/actions/resolve-agent-provider/resolve-provider.sh` | ⚠️ Preserved (superseded by `.js`; obsolete-file removal not requested) |\n| `.gitignore` | ✅ Already contains `.agent/dist/` and `.agent/node_modules/` entries — no change needed |\n| `agent/memory` branch | ✅ Exists at `7c7805a25886fbd6869832620a0f8ff6d92fc468` — no reinit needed |\n| `agent/rubrics` branch | ✅ Exists at `b532a696f8c2fcfe6314068b49a50f7eaad602dd` — no reinit needed |\n\n## Customizations Preserved\n\n- `.github/actions/resolve-agent-provider/resolve-provider.sh` — kept (unused after this update; safe to delete later if desired)\n- All target-only `.github/` files (e.g. `agent-approve.yml`, `agent-branch-cleanup.yml`, etc.) — untouched\n\n## Removed Files\n\nNone (obsolete-file removal was not requested for this run).\n\n## Validation Results\n\n- `npm --prefix .agent ci` — ✅ passed\n- `npm --prefix .agent run build` — ✅ passed (TypeScript compilation clean)\n- `npm --prefix .agent test` — ✅ 713/713 tests passed, 0 failed (27 new tests in v0.3.1)\n- YAML syntax check for all `.github/workflows/*.yml` — ✅ all 25 files valid\n- `git diff --cached --check` (whitespace) — ✅ clean\n\n## Memory / Rubrics Branch Status\n\n- `agent/memory` — ✅ exists at `7c7805a25886fbd6869832620a0f8ff6d92fc468`\n- `agent/rubrics` — ✅ exists at `b532a696f8c2fcfe6314068b49a50f7eaad602dd`\n\n## Post-Merge Notes\n\n1. No secrets changes required — existing auth paths are unchanged.\n2. **`AGENT_MODEL_POLICY`** (new optional secret from v0.3.0) — if not yet configured, this optional JSON secret enables per-route model/reasoning-effort selection. Not required; defaults apply if absent.\n3. `resolve-provider.sh` is now unused and can be deleted via a follow-up PR if desired.\n4. Smoke test after merge: open an issue and mention `@sepo-agent /answer` to verify the updated runtime.",
